[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5402.31, "timestamp": "01:30:02", "text": "是的，药物和绷带也很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5403.7, "timestamp": "01:30:03", "text": "身处其中"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5414.51, "timestamp": "01:30:14", "text": "上帝是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5421.75, "timestamp": "01:30:21", "text": "急救包？哦等等，我的药放在哪儿了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5424.55, "timestamp": "01:30:24", "text": "成套工具"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5438.95, "timestamp": "01:30:38", "text": "去看看，这个地方也已经完工了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5442.23, "timestamp": "01:30:42", "text": "现在这个地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5445.189, "timestamp": "01:30:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5448.99, "timestamp": "01:30:48", "text": "对，这是个奖项之类的，好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5452.87, "timestamp": "01:30:52", "text": "所以把它留在这里行不通。"}]